# Local scratch copy of the homepage — the real one is index.html.
index_backup.html

# NOTE (2026-08-11): videos and photo originals ARE committed on purpose.
# They are Praveen's source material and being in git is what backs them up.
# Cost of that choice: ~21MB in the repo, and git keeps every future version of
# a binary forever — so re-export rather than re-commit variants of the same
# clip, and if the repo ever feels slow, that is the thing to revisit.

# The live reviews file is written on the server by the cafegopala-reviews cron
# job (avyangah-infra). Committing it here would let the deploy overwrite the
# live copy with a stale one. The fallback lives at data/reviews-fallback.json.
data/reviews.json
